course: dictionary
lesson: 9115
title: One word, two jobs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Smiley has two jobs. As an adjective, it describes someone who smiles a lot and feels cheerful. As a noun, a smiley is a little smiling face, drawn or typed, like :-) or an emoji.
explain: Look at the words around it. «Short forms are much older than phones: "O.M.G." turns up in a letter from 1917, and the sideways smiley :-) was suggested in 1982, before most people had ever seen a mobile.» Here the smiley is a noun, because the sideways :-) is a face made from keys.
explain: Ask which job the word is doing. Is it describing a person, or standing for a face? Then swap your meaning into the sentence to check it still makes sense.
fact: Smiley means smiling a lot, or cheerful.
fact: A smiley is a little smiling face, drawn or typed, like :-).
fact: Smiley can be an adjective, as in a smiley person, or a noun, as in a smiley on a card.
fact: «Short forms» are shortened words, and «O.M.G.» is one of them.
fact: The sideways smiley :-) was suggested in 1982, before most people had a mobile phone.
exercise: Mrs Patel puts a smiley on every good piece of work. What is the smiley here? | A type of cloud | A cross drawn in red ink | A kind of sweet | *A little smiling face drawn on the page
exercise: «The smiley old man waved at everyone who passed.» What does smiley describe? | Very tall | Sleepy and yawning | Angry and shouting | *Cheerful and smiling a lot
exercise: In «the sideways smiley :-) was suggested in 1982», what is the smiley? | A month of the year | A kind of phone | *A little smiling face made from keys | A long letter
test: «Our smiley class always laughs at lunch.» What does smiley mean here? | *Smiling a lot and cheerful | Lost and confused | Crying a lot and upset | Very quiet and still
test: Which of these is a smiley? | *:-) | A cloud | A petrol station | A wet day
exam: Which sentence uses smiley as an adjective? | Dad sent a smiley in an email. | *Our smiley guide greeted every visitor. | Teachers drew a smiley on my work. | I typed a smiley after my text.
